  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1413",
    "issue_date": "2026-10-08T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-08T12:19:49.282Z",
    "meteorologist": "Sanjib Adhikari",
    "analysis_np": "हाल देशमा पश्चिमी न्यून चापीय प्रणालीका साथै मनसुनी वायुको प्रभाव समेत रहेको छ।",
    "analysis_en": "Currently, the country is under the influence of a westerly low-pressure system, along with monsoon winds.",
    "today_np": "कोशी प्रदेशका सबै भू-भाग तथा देशका बाँकी हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्ने छ। देशको बाँकी तराई भु-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ। कोशी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ । बागमती,गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यम वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ । मधेश प्रदेश तथा कोशी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागमा थोरै स्थानमा तथा बाँकी तराई भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ। गण्डकी प्रदेशको पहाडी भू-भागको एक-दुई स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ ।",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions will prevail throughout Koshi Province and in the remaining Himalayan and hilly regions of the country. Partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the remaining Terai regions of the country. Moderate rain/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning is likely at a few places in the Himalayan and hilly regions of Koshi, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces. Moderate rainfall/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning is likely at one or two places in the Himalayan and hilly regions of Bagmati, Gandaki, and Lumbini Provinces. Moderate rainfall accompanied by thunder and lightning is likely at a few places in Madhesh Province and the Terai regions of Koshi and Sudurpashchim Provinces, and at one or two places in the remaining Terai regions. Heavy rainfall is likely at one or two places in the hilly region of Gandaki Province.",
    "tomorrow_np": "देशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ। मधेश प्रदेश तथा कोशी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल तथा बाँकी तराई भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ। देशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका केही स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग, हावाहुरी र असिना सहित मध्यम वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ । मधेश लगायत कोशी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागको केही स्थानमा तथा बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ। कोशी, बागमती र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको पहाडी भू-भाग तथा कोशी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy conditions will prevail in the Himalayan and hilly regions of the country. Generally cloudy conditions will prevail in Madhesh Province and the Terai regions of Koshi and Sudurpashchim Provinces, while partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the remaining Terai regions. Moderate rain/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning, windstorms, and hail is likely at some places in the Himalayan and hilly regions of the country. Moderate rainfall accompanied by thunder and lightning is likely at some places in Madhesh Province and the Terai regions of Koshi and Sudurpashchim Provinces, and at a few places in the Terai regions of Bagmati, Gandaki, and Lumbini Provinces. Heavy rainfall is likely at one or two places in the hilly regions of Koshi, Bagmati, and Sudurpashchim Provinces, and the Terai region of Koshi Province.",
    "special": ""
  }
